        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP)": "No",
        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP) Sub-parameters": "CP1: The agent identifies and confirms all of the user’s concerns and key issues before proposing a solution.",
        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP) Observations": "CP2: The agent misinterpreted or misrepresented information from the backend system.\r\n\r\nAt chat timestamp 19 May, 11:58:52, the customer was informed that the order was being returned to the seller; however, the specific return-related updates reflected in the backend were not fully communicated. This includes the status dated\r\n05-18-2026 09:07 +0800, ‘On Hold – Delivery attempt was unsuccessful: Rejected By Recipient,’ along with the subsequent update,\r\n‘Delivery attempt was unsuccessful: Recipient Request Reschedule Delivery’ dated 05-18-2026 16:21 +0800, including the corresponding courier detail information. (Two failed delivery attempts)",
