        "Solution (S) Sub-parameters": "S1: The agent provides accurate and complete solutions relevant to the customer’s reported issue.",
        "Solution (S) Observations": "Comment: S1: The agent provided an inaccurate or incomplete solution that did not address the user’s concern.\r\nIt was observed that in chat time stamp, 19 May, 12:04:33, the riders information was provided.\r\nFollowing the standard protocol for Rider Contact Information Requests\r\n\r\nFor reference: kb-client/article/46063\r\nSolution - Forward Delivery\r\nOther reasons: Advise the user that due to data privacy, we are unable to provide the rider’s contact information. Assist the buyer with their main intent in getting the rider’s information (e.g. rider behavior complaint, return/refund). Rider information requests for personal reasons and other reasons unrelated to order and delivery should be pushed back. In addition, we can advise the buyer to repurchase since the order is already on the way to the seller.",
