        "SOP Compliance (SC) Observations": "Comment:\r\nSC11: The agent did not utilize SOPA as a reference during case handling. \r\n\r\nThere was an opportunity to further align case handling with SOPA utilization guidelines. Upon further review, no associated email address of the agent was identified in the system records that would indicate SOPA utilization during the handling of the case. \r\n\r\n",
