        "SOP Compliance (SC) Sub-parameters": "SC6: The agent selects the correct reason code and avoids choosing an incorrect reason code at any level.",
        "SOP Compliance (SC) Observations": "Comment: SC6: The agent selected the wrong Reason Code or failed to fill it in accurately at any level.\r\nRelevant Reason Code:\r\nL1:Logistics\r\nL2: Delivery\r\nL3: Parcel logistics status not moving (Stuck)\r\nExplanation: Buyer/Seller is following up on an order that is not moving (≥ 3 days) or is stuck at a sorting facility, and delivery hub.\r\nSuggestion for further success:\r\nAs a best practice, carefully review the Revamped PH QA Reason Code, order status, backend movement history,  before selecting the final Reason Code classification. Ensuring accurate tagging helps support proper case documentation, reporting accuracy, and alignment with the actual customer concern.",
