        "Gathering Information (GI) Observations": "n/a",
        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP)": "No",
        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP) Sub-parameters": "CP2: The agent correctly interprets and uses information from the backend system and does not misstate system data to the user.",
        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP) Observations": "Comment: CP2: The agent misinterpreted or misrepresented information from the backend system.\r\n\r\nAn opportunity was observed to provide a more complete and accurate root cause explanation based on the backend order details. Upon further review, the explanation did not include whether the order status was still within the Estimated Delivery Date (EDD) timeline or already beyond the committed delivery period.\r\nEstimated Delivery Date: 05-25-2026 16:27 +0800\r\n\r\nSuggestion for further success:\r\nAs a best practice, thoroughly review and communicate all relevant backend details related to the order timeline, including:\r\n\r\n* Current delivery status\r\n* Latest tracking movement\r\n* Estimated Delivery Date (EDD)\r\n* Whether the order is still within or already beyond the EDD\r\n\r\nProviding complete context regarding the delivery timeline can help improve transparency, manage customer expectations more effectively, and support accurate resolution handling.",
