        "Solution (S) Observations": "Comment: S1: The agent provided an inaccurate or incomplete solution that did not address the user’s concern.\r\nAn opportunity was observed to provide the root cause explanation first before proceeding with additional information or actions during the interaction. In this case, the rider’s contact information was initially provided prior to explaining the delivery status and backend findings related to the order. In addition,  the contact information from Pixie, Shopee’s virtual assistant was not provided .\r\n\r\n20 May, 15:35:30: Rider’s phone number was provided first\r\n20 May, 15:36:51: Root cause and delivery status explanation were communicated afterward\r\n\r\nSuggestion for further Success:\r\nAs a best practice, provide the root cause explanation and latest delivery status updates first before sharing additional information such as the rider’s contact details. Additionally, ensure that the suggested spiel for contact information generated through Pixie, Shopee’s virtual assistant, is properly provided when applicable to support complete and accurate assistance.\r\n\r\nApplying this approach can help improve expectation setting and following overall standard solution process during the interaction.",
