        "Greeting & Etiquette (GE) Observations": "Comment: GE10: The agent failed to respond within the required 2-minute response time threshold.\r\nAn opportunity was observed to maintain response times within the required 2-minute threshold to support continuous customer engagement and improve chat flow efficiency.\r\nObserved Timeline:\r\n\r\n08:26:31 to 08:31:04 : Total response time recorded was 4 minutes and 33 seconds, which exceeded the required response time threshold.\r\n\r\nSuggestion for further success: As a best practice, monitor response intervals closely and provide timely follow-up messages when additional checking or processing time is needed. Sending brief holding statements can help reassure the customer that the concern is actively being handled. If more time is required beyond the expected response window, consider proactively asking the customer for additional time before continuing the review. This helps manage expectations and maintains a positive customer experience.",
