        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP) Observations": "Comment: CP2: The agent misinterpreted or misrepresented information from the backend system.\r\n\r\nAn opportunity was observed to provide a more complete and accurate root cause explanation based on the latest backend tracking update. Upon further review, at the time the customer contacted, the order status was already *05-26-2026 05:05 +0800 – RETURN_INITIATED / Return_FMHub_Received*, indicating that the parcel had arrived at the sorting facility (MINI Hub Lavezares) and was already in the return flow.\r\n\r\nSuggestion for Further Success:\r\nAs a best practice, ensure that the most recent tracking status and correct return flow stage are fully reviewed and communicated during customer interactions. This includes clearly stating when an order is already marked as RETURN_INITIATED and has entered the return logistics process.\r\n\r\nProviding a complete and accurate root cause explanation can help:\r\n\r\n* Improve understanding of the order’s actual status and movement stage\r\n* Ensure accurate expectation setting for customers",
