        "Greeting & Etiquette (GE) Observations": "The agent communicated a delay by saying 'Allow me to check po.' but did not provide an explicit estimated time frame for the wait, which violates the criterion that requires an explicit time estimation when placing the customer on hold or checking the system\r\n\r\n The agent did not provide an update after checking for more than 180 seconds, which violates the criterion that requires the agent to proactively communicate if more time is needed to avoid delays or user confusion.\r\n\r\nThe agent did not respond within 2 minutes since the last response, which violates the criterion that requires the agent to respond within 2 minutes during the rest of the consultation.",
