        "Effective Communication (EC) Sub-parameters": "EC8: The agent ensured all information provided was consistent and did not contain conflicting or contradictory details.",
        "Effective Communication (EC) Observations": "EC8: The agent provided unclear, inaccurate, or conflicting information.\r\nAn opportunity was observed to ensure consistency and accuracy of information provided during the interaction. Upon further review, the response at *26 May, 15:34:25* indicated that the order was beyond the Estimated Delivery Date (EDD), while a subsequent response at *26 May, 15:37:25* stated that the order was not yet in the Philippines. These statements present conflicting information regarding the order’s status and location.\r\n\r\nSuggestion for Further Success:\r\nAs a best practice, ensure that all responses are aligned with the latest and most accurate backend tracking information before providing updates to the customer. Consistent and verified information helps avoid confusion and ensures a clear understanding of the order’s actual status.",
