        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP) Sub-parameters": "CP2: The agent correctly interprets and uses information from the backend system and does not misstate system data to the user.",
        "Comprehension of the Problem (CP) Observations": "Comment: CP2: The agent misinterpreted or misrepresented information from the backend system.\r\n\r\nAn opportunity was observed to provide a more complete and accurate root cause explanation based on the backend order information. Upon further review, there was no existing return/refund request, and the order was already beyond the *Buyer Return Request Due Date (03-20-2026 14:55 +0800)*. This key detail was not fully communicated during the interaction, resulting in an incomplete explanation of the order’s eligibility status.\r\n\r\nFor reference: [Buyer] Refund Outside Shopee Returns Window\r\nkb-client/article/13209\r\n\r\nSuggestion for Further Success:\r\nAs a best practice, fully review all relevant order details prior to providing a resolution, including the full order timeline, current status, and any existing or non-existing return/refund requests. This ensures that customers receive accurate and complete information aligned with their concern.\r\n\r\nA thorough review of backend information can help:\r\n\r\n* Ensure accurate identification of return/refund eligibility\r\n* Provide complete and transparent root cause explanations\r\n* Avoid incomplete or misleading order status communication\r\n* Improve overall resolution quality and customer understanding",
